  "implemented": [
    "Same-response private inventory targets retain original AgentRow, directory handle and item identity; exact cancel and settled expiry revoke old Arc authority while public history remains.",
    "One-use 300-second review, bounded RAM registries and caller UUIDs; profile-aware complete selected User layer and full skills.config array preservation; inspect/confirm/status/cancel/read-only recheck registered with flat camelCase arguments.",
    "Fixed initialize/config-read/skills-list/one optional value-write/readback sequence with absolute deadline and bounded frames. expectedVersion is not cross-process CAS; no auto retry or rollback.",
    "Only four exact official pre-write error codes in a valid matching write-error envelope mean rejected. UserLayerNotFound/generic error/lost pipe remain unknown after dispatch; ack and observations are retained separately.",
    "Private pending review and final outcome become public only with terminal state. Late cleanup or duplicate completion cannot regress terminal state. Known rejected ack survives cleanup failure; a fresh read-only recheck reports its own observation without changing that ack.",
    "Shared inventory/management real-worker budget of two, configuration guard, AccountScope and ActivityPermit stay owned through actual child/group/pipe completion; observer cancellation never rolls back a dispatched write."
  ],
